# Check out text files with LF everywhere. The Windows CI runner used to get
# CRLF from git autocrlf, and plain `prettier --check` (endOfLine lf) then
# flagged every file; the retired Prettier baseline had hidden that by
# normalising line endings before comparing.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
